HST Office document tabs: several documents in one window with a tab strip.

Design ("tab group", see framework/inc/documenttabgroup.hxx): every document keeps its own
task frame and top-level window (menubar, Tabbed ribbon, sidebar, status bar, title stay
per document as upstream). The windows of the group share one position/size/maximized
state; only the active one is shown, the others are hidden ("parked"), so the taskbar has
one entry. A VCL-painted tab strip, placed by the LayoutManager between the top docking
area and the document, shows title, modified dot, module colour and a close button per
tab, and a "+" button (new text document / spreadsheet / presentation / open file).
- Joining: LoadEnv, SfxFrame::Appear and autorecovery call DocumentTabs::prepareShow()
  before showing a frame (geometry applied while unmapped); any other show is caught by a
  VCL WindowShow listener. Desktop task frames with a WorkWindow only; never headless/LOK.
- Parked frames keep IsHidden=false (XFrameImpl::windowHidden), so CloseDispatcher treats
  them as open documents: closing the shown tab closes only that frame and the group shows
  a neighbour (no Start Center, no termination). Tab close dispatches .uno:CloseWin (save
  query on the then shown window); Desktop::terminate suppresses neighbour re-showing.
- Title-bar close of a tab window closes the whole group like a browser window: the other
  tabs first (each modified one shown, then its save query), the clicked tab last; Cancel on
  any query keeps that tab and the remaining ones open. The tab's own close button closes
  only that tab.
- Full-screen slide shows (their own frame in a presentation-mode window) never join a group.
- Menubar with the Tabbed UI: a parked tab keeps its menubar attached (LayoutManager), the
  notebookbar applies its menubar mode to the frame it sets up and CloseMethod only restores
  the menubar of its own window (not of SfxViewFrame::Current(), possibly another tab).
- Keys: .uno:NextDocumentTab / .uno:PrevDocumentTab on Ctrl+Alt+. / Ctrl+Alt+, (Global
  accelerators; Ctrl+Tab, Ctrl+PgUp/PgDn and Ctrl+Alt+PgUp/PgDn are taken by Writer and Calc).
- Option Office.Common/Misc/DocumentTabs (default true), Tools > Options > HST Office >
  General > "Document Tabs"; switching it off shows every tab as a window again.
- Vietnamese strings for the new UI texts (framework, cui, GenericCommands).

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0); new files MPL-2.0.
Test: tests/runtime/check-document-tabs.py under Xvfb.
